<title>USA: Sweet Home CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt. [CORRECTED 17:03 GMT]</title>
<headline>Sweet Home CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt. [CORRECTED 17:03 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects the headline and the text to show the winner as Roosevelt and Cross, not PaineWebber Inc.)</p>
<p>Roosevelt and Cross said it won $6.100 million of Sweet Home CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.9987 (corrects figure from 4.97) percent.</p>
</text>
